<title>USA: Spectrum Information Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Spectrum Information Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.01     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net	   loss	   532     loss	 1,300</p>
<p> Revs			   205			504</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.03			nil</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 2,000     loss	   123</p>
<p> Revs			 1,700		    2,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Spectrum Information Technologies Inc said the third quarter and first nine months ending December 31, 1996 include a gain of $531,000 from the liquidation of the discontinued Data One subsidiary.</p>
<p>The first nine months of 1995 included a gain of $1.6 million for the sale of a product line and related patent rights and a $4.1 million gain for discontinued operations.</p>
